opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Pure combat engine and probability model for the Symbaroum RPG"
description:
  "The domain core: encounter state, commands, undo, import/export codec, and anexact absorption-probability model for encounter difficulty. Depends on noJavaScript runtime -- `dune build -p symbaroum` is the CI check that keeps itthat way."
maintainer: ["Adnan Dervisevic"]
authors: ["Adnan Dervisevic"]
license: "MIT"
homepage: "https://github.com/AdnanDervisevic/symbaroum-combat-tracker"
bug-reports:
